Use min/max to prune partition may cause correctness problems like fowlling:

```
create table t (x int) partition by range (x) (
partition p0 values less than (5),
partition p1 values less than (10),
partition p2 values less than (15)
);

explain select max(x) from t;
```

If partition p2 has no data,  only reading partition p2 will be wrong.
